<title>RUSSIA: TENNIS-WOMEN'S KREMLIN CUP SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WOMEN'S KREMLIN CUP SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the $400,000</p>
<p>Kremlin Cup women's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat 7-Barbara Schett (Austria) 4-6</p>
<p>6-4 6-4</p>
<p>1-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat 4-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium)</p>
<p>6-3 5-7 6-3</p>
</text>
